# mbsync config — hessenbox encrypted mail archive
# Account blocks: fill in Host / User, then copy to ~/.mbsyncrc
# Passwords live SEPARATELY in ~/.config/imap-passwords/{faculty,verwaltung} (chmod 600)
#   -- never in this file, never in the synced Nextcloud folder.

# ---------- faculty dovecot ----------
IMAPAccount faculty
Host        imap.fakultaet.example.de   # your server
Port        993
User        your-imap-user              # your login
PassCmd     "cat ~/.config/imap-passwords/faculty"
SSLType     IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore faculty-remote
Account faculty

MaildirStore faculty-local
Path        ~/mail-archive/faculty/
Inbox       ~/mail-archive/faculty/INBOX
SubFolders  Verbatim

Channel faculty
Far  :faculty-remote:
Near :faculty-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
# Expunge Both   = mirror server deletions   (default)
# Expunge None   = archive keeps everything even if deleted on server

# ---------- Verwaltung exchange ----------
IMAPAccount verwaltung
Host        outlook.verwaltung.example.de   # your server
Port        993
User        you@work.example.edu        # your login
PassCmd     "cat ~/.config/imap-passwords/verwaltung"
SSLType     IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore verwaltung-remote
Account verwaltung

MaildirStore verwaltung-local
Path        ~/mail-archive/verwaltung/
Inbox       ~/mail-archive/verwaltung/INBOX
SubFolders  Verbatim

Channel verwaltung
Far  :verwaltung-remote:
Near :verwaltung-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
